            "text": "Finalize a training run. The backend selects the kept iteration with the highest holdout score, decides champion vs challenger via the promotion ladder, and persists the model. best_iteration_id is advisory: it breaks a tie at the top score and is otherwise logged and ignored. Agents cannot set the champion directly, because promotion is server-side.",
